<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>MP7 No Recoil</Major>
    <Description>This macro removes almost all of MP7 recoil.
In game settings:
Fov 84
1920x1080
ADS sens 50
dpi 800
1x 40

MP7 build :
Compensator
Holo

If the macro isn't pulling hard enough lower the delays.
If the macro is pulling too hard make the delays higher.
If it still isnt acurate try changing the mouse values but make sure to change 1x/y at a time for optimal testing.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 32 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 32 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 32 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 32 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 32 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 32 ms
MoveR 0 3</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>